## Phase 1: Backend — Новые таблицы и API

### [NEW] SQL миграция `002_spreadsheet_engine.sql`
Создание таблиц: `spreadsheets`, `spreadsheet_sheets`, `spreadsheet_cells`, `spreadsheet_merged_regions`, `spreadsheet_column_configs`, `spreadsheet_data_sources`

### [NEW] `packages/backend/src/modules/spreadsheet/`
```
spreadsheet/
├── spreadsheet.module.ts
├── controllers/
│   └── spreadsheet.controller.ts    # REST API для CRUD
├── services/
│   └── spreadsheet.service.ts       # Business logic
├── dto/
│   ├── spreadsheet.dto.ts           # Create/Update DTOs
│   ├── sheet.dto.ts
│   ├── cell.dto.ts
│   └── responses/
│       └── spreadsheet.response.dto.ts
└── entities/
    └── spreadsheet.entity.ts
```

**Endpoints**:
| Method | Path | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/spreadsheets` | Создать spreadsheet |
| `GET` | `/spreadsheets` | Список (фильтры: org, sport, status) |
| `GET` | `/spreadsheets/:id` | Полный spreadsheet с sheets + cells |
| `PUT` | `/spreadsheets/:id` | Обновить метаданные |
| `DELETE` | `/spreadsheets/:id` | Удалить с каскадом |
| `POST` | `/spreadsheets/:id/sheets` | Добавить sheet |
| `PUT` | `/spreadsheets/:id/sheets/:sheetId` | Обновить sheet |
| `DELETE` | `/spreadsheets/:id/sheets/:sheetId` | Удалить sheet |
| `PUT` | `/spreadsheets/:id/sheets/:sheetId/cells` | Batch update cells |
| `PUT` | `/spreadsheets/:id/sheets/:sheetId/columns` | Update column configs |
| `POST` | `/spreadsheets/:id/publish` | Опубликовать |
| `POST` | `/spreadsheets/:id/clone` | Клонировать |

