## Phase 2: Frontend — Модуль SpreadsheetEngine

### [NEW] `packages/frontend/src/modules/spreadsheet/`
```
spreadsheet/
├── types/
│   ├── spreadsheet.types.ts     # Spreadsheet, Sheet, Cell, ColumnConfig, DataSource
│   └── index.ts
├── api/
│   └── spreadsheet.api.ts       # API client (typed)
├── stores/
│   └── useSpreadsheetStore.ts   # Zustand store
├── lib/
│   ├── formula-engine.ts        # HyperFormula wrapper (свежий, без legacy)
│   ├── data-source-registry.ts  # Unified data sourcing
│   └── cell-utils.ts            # Helper functions
├── hooks/
│   ├── useSpreadsheet.hook.ts
│   ├── useSheetManager.hook.ts
│   └── useCellSelection.hook.ts
├── ui/
│   ├── SpreadsheetEditor.tsx    # Главный компонент (Admin mode)
│   ├── SpreadsheetViewer.tsx    # Read-only/User mode
│   ├── SpreadsheetGrid.tsx      # ag-grid wrapper
│   ├── SpreadsheetToolbar.tsx   # Bold, Italic, Merge, Lock, DataType
│   ├── FormulaBar.tsx
│   ├── SheetTabs.tsx            # Управление вкладками (с data)
│   ├── PropertiesPanel.tsx      # Правая панель свойств ячейки
│   ├── DataSourcePicker.tsx     # Выбор источника данных (ref/indicator)
│   ├── ContextMenu.tsx
│   └── index.ts
└── index.ts
```

### Key Design Decisions

1. **ag-grid Community** — grid rendering, virtual scroll, cell editing
2. **HyperFormula** — formula engine, multi-sheet support built-in
3. **Zustand** — state management, granular selectors
4. **DataSourceRegistry** — unified interface для справочников и индикаторов
5. **Server-first** — все изменения идут на сервер, optimistic updates на клиенте

